{"payload":{"files":{"BOOST.md":"---\nname: Roomier HN comments\nsites: news.ycombinator.com\nmade: Yab recipe\npreview: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=1\nchecks:\n  - on /*: some of .comment\n  - on /*: some of body\n---\n\nGive Hacker News discussions a readable width and spacing.\n","manifest.json":"{\n  \"manifest_version\": 3,\n  \"name\": \"Roomier HN comments\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"content_scripts\": [\n    {\n      \"matches\": [\n        \"https://news.ycombinator.com/*\"\n      ],\n      \"css\": [\n        \"page/style.css\"\n      ],\n      \"run_at\": \"document_end\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","page/style.css":".comment { max-width: 78ch; line-height: 1.7 !important; }\n.comtr td { padding-bottom: 6px; }\n"},"format":1,"id":"hn-wide-comments","sites":["news.ycombinator.com"]},"revision":"7e2962cf85cdd22a490fd8e7c91e0084265ffec8efe2cb2f866155fc59e0822c"}